# Git was mangling binary files: core.autocrlf=true with no attributes file
# meant every committed .db blob had CRLF/LF substituted INSIDE binary data.
# That is why databases restored from history are corrupt and why "database
# disk image is malformed" kept appearing. Never let git touch these as text.
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
